<title>USA: Packaging Plus set 1-for-12 reverse split.</title>
<headline>Packaging Plus set 1-for-12 reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>PLAINVIEW, N.Y. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Packaging Plus Services Inc said its board has declared a 1 for 12 reverse stock split of its Class A common stock, with respect to stockholders of record on November 8.</p>
<p>The company indicated that it is preparing an application for listing of its common stock on Nasdaq.</p>
